# UI Structure

Implementation map for `src/ui/`. Product intent lives in `docs/product/ui-design.md`.

## Folder layout

```
src/ui/
├── App.vue                 # Root shell, global shortcuts (save/load)
├── views/
│   └── GameView.vue        # Two-column layout (narration + dashboard)
├── components/
│   ├── narration/          # NarrationPanel, ActionPanel, QuickActions, EntityPicker
│   └── dashboard/          # DashboardPanel, widgets, topic views, entity sheets
├── composables/            # Shared UI logic (player actions, lookups, picker options)
├── stores/                 # Pinia — UI state only
└── styles/
    ├── main.css            # Global tokens and resets
    └── dashboard.css       # Shared dashboard classes
```

## Data access

- Read runtime state: `useGameState()` from `@state/useGameState`
- Read static content / labels: `@data/*` or Engine lookups — do not copy catalogs into Pinia
- Mutate simulation: `@engine/index` exports only
- Vue components never mutate `GameState` directly

## Pinia

`src/ui/stores/` holds UI-only state (dashboard navigation, selection, modals). Never duplicate `GameState` or static content.

## Component map

| UI concept | Component |
|------------|-----------|
| Two-column shell | `GameView` |
| Narration log | `NarrationPanel` |
| Free-text action input | `ActionPanel` |
| Quick action shortcuts | `QuickActions` |
| Parameter picker | `EntityPicker` |
| Dashboard shell + breadcrumbs | `DashboardPanel` |
| Dashboard navigation store | `useDashboardNavigation` |
| Home widgets | `TimeWidget`, `ResourcesWidget`, `CharactersWidget`, `PlacesWidget` |
| Topic views | `ResourcesTopic`, `CharactersTopic`, `PlacesTopic` |
| Entity sheets | `CharacterSheet`, `PlaceSheet` |

## Composables

| Concern | Composable |
|---------|------------|
| Execute player actions + feedback | `usePlayerActions` |
| Place/region/resource lookups | `useDashboardLookups` |
| Resource type/subtype labels | `useResourceLabels` |
| Quick-action picker options | `useActionPickerOptions` |

## Current state

| Area | Status |
|------|--------|
| Layout | Two columns in `GameView` |
| Narration | `NarrationPanel`, `ActionPanel`, `QuickActions`, end turn in `GameView` |
| Dashboard | `DashboardPanel` with home widgets, topic views, entity sheets |
| Resource summary | Aggregated on home; full list in `ResourcesTopic` |
| Navigation | Breadcrumbs + `useDashboardNavigation` |
| Quick actions | `QuickActions` + `EntityPicker` in `ActionPanel`; driven by `actions.json` |
| Dashboard shortcuts | Collect on `PlacesTopic` and `PlaceSheet`; go-to on `PlaceSheet` (legacy; prefer quick actions) |

**Deferred:**

- Rich action widgets in the narration column (e.g. trade)
- Removing dashboard gameplay shortcuts

## Adding UI

- New narration-side action UI → `components/narration/`
- New dashboard view or widget → `components/dashboard/` (widgets, topics, or sheets)
- New UI-only state → `stores/`
- Shared logic used by multiple components → `composables/`
